Modification notice
-------------------
This repository adapts the template for a Master of Science thesis and
includes Korean font and layout adjustments, circled approval marks,
VS Code configuration, and English/Korean usage documentation.
It is a modified version of the original work.

Scope and third-party materials
------------------------------
This notice covers the template material and accompanying documentation.
It does not relicense third-party font files in fonts/ or other third-party
assets. Those materials remain subject to their respective rights and
license terms; their presence here is not evidence of a CC BY 4.0 grant.
No separate font license files are included in this repository at the time
of writing. Check the relevant rights-holder terms before redistributing
those files.

Using this template does not by itself place your original thesis text,
research, or independently supplied figures under CC BY 4.0.
